 "note": "Nigerian History is compulsory from Primary 1 to JSS 3 under the revised curriculum announced by the Federal Ministry of Education on 3 September 2025. The official NERDC subject curriculum document (topics and performance objectives) was not available to us. The class and term topics below are taken from published schemes of work that say they follow the NERDC curriculum; they have not been checked against the official document and may differ from your school's scheme. Always follow your teacher.",
